:: Wardrobe [no-fainting-or-hunger no-party-time-loss] {"position":"1625,350","size":"100,100"}
<h1><b>Your equipment</b></h1>\
<nobr>Head: <<if $player.helmet is "None">> Helmet <<else>> <<link "$player.helmet.name">> 
    /* Same code as personality select. I have no idea why or how it works but it does! */
    <<set _count = 0>>
    <<set _tag = $player.helmet.id>>
    <<for _count = 0; $inventory[_tag]; _count++>>
      <<set _tag = $player.helmet.id + (_count + 1)>>
    <</for>>
    <<set $inventory[_tag] = $player.helmet>>
    <<goto "Wardrobe">>
  <<set $player.helmet = "None">> 
  <<goto "Wardrobe">>
  <</link>> <</if>> </nobr>
<nobr>Body: <<if $player.shirt is "None">> Shirt <<else>> <<link "$player.shirt.name">> 
    /* Same code as personality select. I have no idea why or how it works but it does! */
